    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. The architecture follows the ARP Solina/Omni family in outline (octave-related sawtooths per key, one shared filter, a three-line chorus whose LFOs sit 120 degrees apart at about 0.6 Hz and 6 Hz); it is not a circuit model."
